==English==

===Adjective===
'''incidental'''
# Loosely associated; existing as a [[byproduct]], [[tangent]], or [[accident]].
#:''That character, though colorful, is '''incidental''' to the overall plot.''
# Entering or approaching, prior to [[reflection]] (more frequently [[incident]]).

